msgctxt "92"
msgid "Agh... Those kids really messed me up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey, are you okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"These little punks swarmed me all of a sudden, laughing about \"hunting "
"homeless\"..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Unforgivable... Anyone who doesn't follow Kamurocho's rules doesn't deserve "
"to live here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I have a favor to ask you⑬from one man of Kamurocho to another!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "Oh, yeah? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "I need you to help our friends!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Help how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "As it happens, those punks have been targeting us homeless for a reason."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "They stormed our main shelter, and turned it into their own hideout!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Some abandoned building in Kamurocho, I take it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Yeah. When Kamurocho Hills was slated for construction in Purgatory three "
"years ago, we had to hole up somewhere else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"But now those thugs have driven us out of our building... and whenever they "
"see us, they beat us down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "They're the worst of the worst."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"These young thugs are too much for us! Can you step in for us, and take "
"back the Dragon Palace once and for all?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Did you say it's the \"Dragon Palace\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Yep! That's what we've been calling the place. The Dragon Palace!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"(The name sounds familiar... I feel like I heard about this Dragon Palace "
"some three years back.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Where is this Dragon Palace, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"It's behind the MEB info center! So how 'bout it? Wanna take the Dragon "
"Palace back from these punks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Sure. Kamurocho is no place for that kind of toxic mold. We can't let it go "
"unchecked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "I'm not going to let some pack of kids ruin my town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"I... I'm not sure what you're gettin' at, but thanks all the same! You're "
"our savior! Good luck out there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"(He said the Dragon Palace was behind the MEB info center. I'll have to "
"check it out sometime.)"
msgstr ""

